<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>풀매수 기원단: HODL or Die — PIXEL EDITION</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Press+Start+2P&family=VT323&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
/* ── PIXEL DESIGN SYSTEM ─────────────────────────────────── */
:root{
  --bg:#02040a;
  --panel:#080e1c;
  --panel2:#0c1428;
  --green:#00ff41;
  --green2:#00c832;
  --green-dim:#003a14;
  --red:#ff1a3c;
  --red2:#cc0028;
  --red-dim:#3a000e;
  --gold:#ffd700;
  --gold2:#e6a800;
  --purple:#9f5fff;
  --cyan:#00e5ff;
  --text:#d4deff;
  --muted:#4a5580;
  --line:#1a2240;
  --line2:#0f172a;
}

.px-border{
  box-shadow:
    0 0 0 2px var(--line),
    inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.04);
  image-rendering:pixelated;
}
.px-border-gold{
  box-shadow:
    0 0 0 2px var(--gold2),
    0 0 0 4px #000,
    inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,215,0,.12);
}
.px-border-green{
  box-shadow:
    0 0 0 2px var(--green2),
    0 0 0 4px #000,
    inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,255,65,.08);
}
.px-border-red{
  box-shadow:
    0 0 0 2px var(--red2),
    0 0 0 4px #000;
}

*{box-sizing:border-box; image-rendering:pixelated;}
html,body{
  margin:0;padding:0;
  background:var(--bg);
  color:var(--text);
  font-family:'VT323',monospace;
  overflow-x:hidden;
}

/* ── CRT LAYER ───────────────────────────────────────────── */
body::before{
  content:'';
  position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:9999;
  pointer-events:none;
  background:repeating-linear-gradient(
    0deg,
    transparent,
    transparent 2px,
    rgba(0,0,0,.08) 2px,
    rgba(0,0,0,.08) 4px
  );
}
body::after{
  content:'';
  position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:9998;
  pointer-events:none;
  background:radial-gradient(ellipse at center,transparent 60%,rgba(0,0,0,.55) 100%);
}

/* ── PIXEL BG CANVAS ─────────────────────────────────────── */
#candleBg{
  position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:0;
  pointer-events:none;
  image-rendering:pixelated;
}

/* ── AMBIENT AMBIENT FLOATING BG CHARTS CONTAINER ────────── */
#bgChartContainer {
  position: fixed;
  inset: 0;
  z-index: 0;
  pointer-events: none;
  overflow: hidden;
}

.ambient-chart-card {
  position: absolute;
  background: rgba(8, 14, 28, 0.78);
  border: 1px solid rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.3);
  box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.85);
  padding: 5px;
  font-family: 'Press Start 2P', monospace;
  font-size: 6px;
  color: var(--text);
  opacity: 0;
  transition: opacity 0.8s ease-in-out;
  image-rendering: pixelated;
  pointer-events: none;
  border-radius: 0;
  will-change: transform, opacity;
}

.ambient-chart-card.up { border-color: rgba(0, 255, 65, 0.4); }
.ambient-chart-card.down { border-color: rgba(255, 26, 60, 0.4); }

.ambient-hdr {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  margin-bottom: 3px;
  font-size: 6px;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
.ambient-hdr .sym { color: var(--gold); }
.ambient-hdr .chg-up { color: var(--green); }
.ambient-hdr .chg-down { color: var(--red); }

.ambient-canvas {
  display: block;
  image-rendering: pixelated;
  image-rendering: crisp-edges;
}

/* ── CABINET (MAIN UI CONTAINER) ────────────────────────── */
.cabinet{
  position:relative;
  max-width:520px;margin:0 auto;min-height:100vh;
  background:linear-gradient(180deg,#080e1c,#02040a 60%);
  border-left:3px solid #1a2240;
  border-right:3px solid #1a2240;
  box-shadow:0 0 80px rgba(0,0,0,.9) inset,0 0 2px var(--cyan) inset;
  overflow:hidden;z-index:1;
}

/* ── TAB NAV ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
.tabnav{
  position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;
  display:flex;
  background:#000;
  border-bottom:3px solid var(--line);
}
.tabnav button{
  flex:1;padding:10px 4px;
  background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;
  color:var(--muted);
  font-family:'Press Start 2P',monospace;
  font-size:7px;
  border-bottom:3px solid transparent;
  transition:none;
  letter-spacing:.02em;
}
.tabnav button.active{
  color:var(--gold);
  border-bottom-color:var(--gold);
  background:rgba(255,215,0,.05);
  text-shadow:0 0 6px rgba(255,215,0,.8);
}
.tabnav button:hover{color:var(--cyan);}

.screen{display:none;position:relative;z-index:1;min-height:calc(100vh - 40px);}
.screen.active{display:block;}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   01 TITLE
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
#screen-title{padding:28px 18px 24px;text-align:center;}

.eyebrow{
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:9px;
  color:var(--red);
  letter-spacing:.06em;
  text-shadow:2px 2px 0 #8b0000, 0 0 10px var(--red);
  animation:blink 1.4s step-end infinite;
}
@keyframes blink{0%,100%{opacity:1;}50%{opacity:0;}}

.badge-wrap{position:relative;height:72px;margin:8px 0 0;}
.jibu-badge{
  position:absolute;top:0;right:12%;
  width:82px;height:82px;
  background:var(--red-dim);
  border:0 solid transparent;
  box-shadow:
    0 0 0 3px var(--red),
    0 0 0 6px #000,
    0 0 0 8px var(--gold2),
    4px 4px 0 #000;
  border-radius:0;
  transform:rotate(12deg);
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-direction:column;
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';color:var(--gold);font-size:10px;line-height:1.2;
  animation:badgeFloat 2.4s steps(4) infinite;
  cursor:default;
}
.jibu-badge span{font-size:7px;color:var(--text);margin-top:4px;}
@keyframes badgeFloat{
  0%{transform:rotate(12deg) translateY(0);}
  50%{transform:rotate(8deg) translateY(-5px);}
  100%{transform:rotate(12deg) translateY(0);}
}

.title-main{
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';
  font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;
  margin:18px 0 4px;
  color:var(--green);
  text-shadow:
    3px 3px 0 #003a14,
    -1px -1px 0 #000,
    0 0 20px rgba(0,255,65,.5);
  letter-spacing:.03em;
}
.title-hodl{
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';
  font-size:14px;
  color:var(--gold);
  text-shadow:
    2px 2px 0 #5c3d00,
    0 0 14px rgba(255,215,0,.6);
  margin-bottom:6px;
  letter-spacing:.05em;
}
.title-tagline{
  font-family:'VT323';font-size:20px;
  color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:22px;
}
.title-tagline b{color:var(--cyan);}

.menu{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;padding:0 4px;}
.menu button{
  position:relative;padding:14px 16px;text-align:left;
  background:var(--panel);
  border:0 solid transparent;
  box-shadow:
    0 0 0 2px var(--green2),
    4px 4px 0 #000;
  color:var(--text);
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:10px;
  cursor:pointer;
  border-radius:0;
  transition:none;
}
.menu button:hover{
  background:var(--green-dim);
  transform:translate(-2px,-2px);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--green),6px 6px 0 #000;
  color:var(--green);
}
.menu button:active{
  transform:translate(2px,2px);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--green2),2px 2px 0 #000;
}
.menu button small{
  display:block;font-family:'VT323';font-size:15px;
  color:var(--muted);margin-top:5px;
}

.ticker-wrap{
  margin-top:24px;
  border-top:3px solid var(--green-dim);
  border-bottom:3px solid var(--green-dim);
  padding:6px 0;overflow:hidden;white-space:nowrap;
  background:#000;
}
.ticker{
  display:inline-block;
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:9px;
  color:var(--green);
  text-shadow:0 0 4px rgba(0,255,65,.6);
  animation:scrollLeft 22s linear infinite;
}
@keyframes scrollLeft{from{transform:translateX(0);}to{transform:translateX(-50%);}}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   02 GAMEPLAY
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
#screen-play{padding:14px 14px 28px;}

.hdr{
  display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
  margin-bottom:8px;
}
.hdr h2{
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:9px;margin:0;
  color:var(--gold);
  text-shadow:1px 1px 0 #5c3d00;
}
.state-tag{
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:7px;
  color:var(--green);
  background:#000;
  border:0;
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--green2),2px 2px 0 #000;
  padding:4px 7px;
}

.news-banner{
  background:#000;
  border:0;
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--red2),2px 2px 0 #000;
  color:var(--gold);
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:7.5px;
  padding:8px 10px;margin-bottom:10px;
  display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
  line-height:1.8;
}
.news-title{color:var(--red);text-shadow:0 0 6px var(--red);}

.balance-main{
  background:var(--panel);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--gold2),0 0 0 4px #000,4px 4px 0 #000;
  padding:10px;text-align:center;margin-bottom:10px;
}
.balance-main .label{
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:7px;color:var(--muted);
  letter-spacing:.05em;
}
.balance-main .total{
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:19px;
  color:var(--green);margin-top:6px;
  text-shadow:2px 2px 0 #003a14, 0 0 12px rgba(0,255,65,.5);
}

.assets-grid{
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px;
}
.asset-card{
  background:var(--panel);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--line),2px 2px 0 #000;
  padding:8px;text-align:center;
}
.asset-card .label{
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:6.5px;color:var(--muted);
  margin-bottom:6px;letter-spacing:.03em;
}
.asset-card .val{
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:11px;color:var(--text);
}
.asset-card .val.highlight{color:var(--gold);}

/* ── PIXEL CANDLESTICK CHART ─────────────────────────────── */
.chart-box{
  position:relative;height:164px;
  background:#000;
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--cyan),0 0 0 4px #000,4px 4px 0 #000;
  margin-bottom:12px;overflow:hidden;
}
.chart-box canvas{
  width:100%;height:100%;display:block;
  image-rendering:pixelated;
  image-rendering:crisp-edges;
}
.chart-header{
  position:absolute;top:5px;left:8px;z-index:10;
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:7px;color:var(--muted);
  text-shadow:1px 1px 0 #000;
}
.chart-header span{color:var(--cyan);text-shadow:0 0 6px var(--cyan);}

.section-title{
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:8px;
  color:var(--gold);
  margin:12px 0 6px;
  display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;
  text-shadow:1px 1px 0 #5c3d00;
}
.section-title span:last-child{
  font-size:7px;color:var(--muted);
}

.hand{display:flex;gap:8px;overflow-x:auto;padding-bottom:10px;}
.hand::-webkit-scrollbar{height:4px;background:#000;}
.hand::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:var(--gold2);}

.card{
  min-width:94px;height:114px;
  background:var(--panel2);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--gold2),0 0 0 4px #000,3px 3px 0 #000;
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;
  align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
  padding:8px 6px;
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:7px;
  color:var(--text);cursor:pointer;flex-shrink:0;
  transition:none;
}
.card:hover{
  background:var(--green-dim);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--green),0 0 0 4px #000,5px 5px 0 #000;
  transform:translate(-2px,-2px);
  color:var(--green);
}
.card:active{transform:translate(2px,2px);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--gold2),1px 1px 0 #000;}
.card .sym{font-size:10px;color:var(--gold);text-shadow:1px 1px 0 #5c3d00;text-align:center;}
.card .sector{font-size:7px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px;}
.card .cost{color:var(--green);font-size:9px;text-shadow:1px 1px 0 #003a14;}
.card .beta{color:var(--purple);font-size:7px;}

.card{position:relative;}
.card::before,.card::after{
  content:'';position:absolute;width:6px;height:6px;
  border-color:var(--gold2);border-style:solid;
}
.card::before{top:2px;left:2px;border-width:2px 0 0 2px;}
.card::after{bottom:2px;right:2px;border-width:0 2px 2px 0;}

.positions-wrap{
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;
  max-height:130px;overflow-y:auto;margin-bottom:10px;
}
.positions-wrap::-webkit-scrollbar{width:4px;background:#000;}
.positions-wrap::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb{background:var(--muted);}

.pos-item{
  background:var(--panel);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--line),2px 2px 0 #000;
  padding:7px 9px;
  display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:7px;
}
.pos-info .name{font-size:9px;color:var(--text);}
.pos-info .detail{font-size:6.5px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px;}
.pos-pnl{text-align:right;}
.pos-pnl .val{font-weight:bold;font-size:8px;}
.pnl-up{color:var(--green);text-shadow:1px 1px 0 #003a14;}
.pnl-down{color:var(--red);text-shadow:1px 1px 0 #5c0010;}

.sell-btn{
  background:var(--red-dim);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--red2),2px 2px 0 #000;
  color:var(--text);
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:7px;
  padding:4px 7px;cursor:pointer;
  border:none;margin-left:8px;
  border-radius:0;
}
.sell-btn:hover{background:var(--red2);transform:translate(-1px,-1px);}
.sell-btn:active{transform:translate(1px,1px);box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--red2),1px 1px 0 #000;}

.sell-all-btn{
  width:100%;padding:14px;
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:11px;
  background:var(--red-dim);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--red),0 0 0 4px #000,5px 5px 0 #000;
  color:var(--gold);border:none;
  cursor:pointer;letter-spacing:.05em;
  text-shadow:2px 2px 0 #5c0010;
  border-radius:0;
  transition:none;
}
.sell-all-btn:hover{
  background:var(--red2);
  transform:translate(-2px,-2px);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--red),0 0 0 4px #000,7px 7px 0 #000;
}
.sell-all-btn:active{
  transform:translate(3px,3px);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--red2),2px 2px 0 #000;
}

.popnum{
  position:absolute;
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:11px;
  pointer-events:none;z-index:10;
  animation:pixelPop .9s steps(8) forwards;
  image-rendering:pixelated;
}
@keyframes pixelPop{
  0%{opacity:0;transform:translateY(4px) scale(.7);}
  15%{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0) scale(1);}
  80%{opacity:1;transform:translateY(-24px) scale(1);}
  100%{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-32px) scale(1);}
}

.confetti-layer{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:80;}
.bill{
  position:absolute;top:-30px;
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:12px;
  color:var(--gold);text-shadow:1px 1px 0 #5c3d00;
  animation:pixelFall 1.6s steps(16) forwards;
}
@keyframes pixelFall{to{transform:translateY(560px) rotate(180deg);opacity:0;}}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   03 SHOP
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
#screen-shop{
  padding:18px 14px 28px;
}
.shop-title{
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:14px;
  color:var(--purple);
  text-shadow:2px 2px 0 #2d006b,0 0 12px rgba(159,95,255,.6);
  margin-bottom:4px;
}
.shop-sub{
  font-family:'VT323';font-size:18px;
  color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:16px;
}
.section-label{
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:8px;
  color:var(--gold);
  box-shadow:inset 3px 0 0 0 var(--gold);
  padding-left:10px;margin:18px 0 10px;
  display:block;
}
.pack-row{display:flex;gap:10px;overflow-x:auto;padding-bottom:6px;}
.pack{
  min-width:108px;height:124px;flex-shrink:0;cursor:pointer;
  background:var(--panel2);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px #3a2a5c,0 0 0 4px #000,3px 3px 0 #000;
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;
  justify-content:center;gap:8px;
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:9px;text-align:center;padding:8px;
  border-radius:0;
}
.pack:hover{
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--purple),0 0 0 4px #000,5px 5px 0 #000;
  transform:translate(-2px,-2px);
}

/* ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   04 EVENT
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
#screen-event{
  min-height:calc(100vh - 40px);
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  padding:20px;
}
.phone-noti{
  width:100%;max-width:360px;
  background:var(--panel);
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--gold2),0 0 0 4px #000,6px 6px 0 #000;
  padding:18px;
}
.noti-headline{
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:10px;
  color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:8px;
  text-shadow:1px 1px 0 #5c3d00;
}
.noti-body{
  font-family:'VT323';font-size:18px;
  color:var(--text);line-height:1.4;margin-bottom:16px;
}
.choice{
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--line),2px 2px 0 #000;
  padding:11px 13px;margin-bottom:10px;cursor:pointer;
  background:var(--panel2);
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:8px;
  transition:none;
}
.choice:hover{
  box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--gold2),4px 4px 0 #000;
  transform:translate(-2px,-2px);
}

.footnote{
  text-align:center;
  font-family:'Press Start 2P';font-size:7px;
  color:var(--muted);padding:18px 20px 10px;
}

.px-corner-box{position:relative;}
.px-corner-box::before,.px-corner-box::after{
  content:'';position:absolute;width:8px;height:8px;
  border-color:var(--cyan);border-style:solid;
  z-index:5;pointer-events:none;
}
.px-corner-box::before{top:2px;left:2px;border-width:2px 0 0 2px;}
.px-corner-box::after{bottom:2px;right:2px;border-width:0 2px 2px 0;}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- pixel bg canvas -->
<canvas id="candleBg"></canvas>

<!-- ambient floating bg stock charts layer -->
<div id="bgChartContainer"></div>

<div class="cabinet">
  <div class="tabnav">
    <button class="active" data-s="title">▶01 타이틀</button>
    <button data-s="play">02 TR룸</button>
    <button data-s="shop">03 암시장</button>
    <button data-s="event">04 찌라시</button>
  </div>

  <!-- ====== 01 TITLE ====== -->
  <section id="screen-title" class="screen active">
    <div class="eyebrow">★ "한강물이 따뜻한가요?" ★</div>
    <div class="badge-wrap">
      <div class="jibu-badge">떡상<span>기원부적</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="title-main">풀매수 기원단</div>
    <div class="title-hodl">HODL or Die</div>
    <div class="title-tagline">시작부터 <b>상한가 가즈아!</b></div>

    <div class="menu">
      <button id="startBtn">▶ 영끌 출격
        <small>GAME START — 계좌 개설 후 즉시 몰빵</small>
      </button>
      <button>▷ 손절 기계
        <small>COLLECTION — 해금한 카드 · 유물 · 밈 도감</small>
      </button>
      <button>▷ 환경 설정
        <small>SETTINGS — 사운드 · 언어 · 심박수 안정화</small>
      </button>
      <button>▷ 파산 기록
        <small>STATS — 역대 반대매매 히스토리</small>
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="ticker-wrap">
      <div class="ticker" id="tickerText"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ====== 02 GAMEPLAY ====== -->
  <section id="screen-play" class="screen">
    <div class="hdr">
      <h2>▌ 도파민 TR룸</h2>
      <span class="state-tag" id="marketStateTag">■ NORMAL</span>
    </div>

    <div class="news-banner" id="newsBanner">
      <span>
